    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "As things stand, you don't have any prestige left, Herman!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "I've spent years training these people. Only they truly understand the wonderful life that comes from hard work!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Today is the climax of the festival. I'll take what has always rightfully belonged to me, and then bounce."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "I bet you still have no idea what's going on."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Let me tell you out of mercy's sake. The data you got from the monitoring station is wrong. The volcano will very soon become active."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Originium will spread along with the eruption, and at least half of this city will be destroyed!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "But I won't lose anything. I'll even come back after the eruption to mine the Originium!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Siesta is my paradise! I also deeply love this city, Herman!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_024"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Herman",
        "text": "How dare you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_023_2#2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Of course I dare, as the Catastrophe Messenger of this city."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "But all you can do is witness your defeat, then the destruction of Siesta!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Of course, you will get the honor of dying to the eruption of the Siesta Volcano. Other than me, nobody else shall know about the secrets of this city."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Your depravity knows no bounds.;In your dreams!;Don't underestimate Rhodes Island.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Rhodes... Island..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_024"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Herman",
        "text": "I'm disappointed in you, Cronin."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_024",
            "name2": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Disappointed? You're the one who's disappointed? No, I'm disappointed in you!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "I'll never forget the days when I lost my home, those sleepless nights in the dumpsters trying to take shelter from the elements!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Wealth is the key to a new life, and I've since come to understand that! But what about you? You wasted the money we worked so hard to earn on some Infected filth?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Cronin",
        "text": "Are you going to bury the infinite potential of Siesta beneath your hypocrisy?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_024",
            "name2": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Herman",
        "text": "Take a good look at yourself, Cronin."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Herman",
        "text": "And take all the time in the world to reflect upon what you see, in prison!"
    },
